{#=============================================================================
  calculators/rule_of_72.html.j2 — Rule of 72 Calculator
  Cloned from position_size.html.j2 (the flagship exemplar). Two modes via a
  §6 segmented toggle: "Rate → years" (r% in → yearsToDouble=72/r, exact
  ln2/ln(1+r/100)) and "Years → rate" (y in → requiredRate=72/y, exact
  100·(2^(1/y)−1)). compute() is PURE; wire() does all DOM; WORKED_EXAMPLES
  runs each §7-style fixture through compute() on load and console.error's
  drift (silent when green). Never render NaN/Infinity; empty/invalid →
  plain-word sentence in .co-plain and "—" in numbers. Inputs accept commas.
=============================================================================#}
{% extends "seo_calculator_base.html.j2" %}
{% import "_estate_glyphs.html.j2" as glyphs %}

{% block calc_glyph %}{{ glyphs.glyph('rule-of-72', 'crown') }}{% endblock %}

{% block calc_form %}
<p class="cc-lede">{{ t('Divide 72 by an annual return to get the years it takes money to double — or divide 72 by a target number of years to get the return you’d need. The exact figure sits alongside so you can see the approximation gap.',
   '用 72 除以年化收益率，得到本金翻倍所需的年数；或用 72 除以目标年数，得到所需的收益率。旁边同时给出精确值，让你看清近似的误差。') }}</p>

<div class="calc-in">
  <div class="ci ci-wide">
    <span class="ci-l">{{ t('What do you want to find?', '你想求什么？') }}</span>
    <div class="ci-seg" role="radiogroup" data-name="mode" aria-label="Mode">
      <button class="on" data-v="rate" type="button">{{ t('Rate → years', '收益率 → 年数') }}</button><button data-v="years" type="button">{{ t('Years → rate', '年数 → 收益率') }}</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <label class="ci" id="row-rate"><span class="ci-l">{{ t('Annual return (%)', '年化收益率（%）') }} <span class="hint">{{ t('compounded', '复利') }}</span></span>
    <input id="rate" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" placeholder="8"></label>
  <label class="ci" id="row-years" hidden><span class="ci-l">{{ t('Years to double', '翻倍年数') }}</span>
    <input id="years" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" placeholder="10"></label>
</div>

<div class="calc-out" aria-live="polite">
  <div class="co-main"><span id="out-main">—</span><span class="co-unit" id="out-unit">{{ t('years', '年') }}</span></div>
  <p class="co-plain" id="out-plain">{{ t('Enter an annual return to see how long money takes to double.', '输入年化收益率，即可看到本金翻倍所需的时间。') }}</p>
  <dl class="co-rows">
    <div><dt>{{ t('Rule-of-72 estimate', '72法则估算') }}</dt><dd id="out-est">—</dd></div>
    <div><dt>{{ t('Exact math', '精确值') }}</dt><dd id="out-exact">—</dd></div>
    <div><dt>{{ t('Approximation gap', '近似误差') }}</dt><dd id="out-gap">—</dd></div>
  </dl>
</div>

<div class="calc-actions">
  <button class="gbtn" id="copy-result" type="button">{{ t('Copy result', '复制结果') }}</button>
  <span class="copied" id="copied" role="status">{{ t('Copied', '已复制') }}</span>
</div>
{% endblock %}

{% block article_body %}
<p>{{ t('To estimate how many years it takes money to double at a steady annual return, divide <strong>72</strong> by that return written as a whole number — at 8% a year, roughly 72 ÷ 8 = <strong>9 years</strong>. Flip it to find the return a doubling in a set time would demand: divide 72 by the years instead. It is a mental-math shortcut for the exact compounding formula, and it lands remarkably close in the range investors actually use.',
   '要估算在稳定的年化收益率下本金翻倍需要多少年，就用 <strong>72</strong> 除以以整数表示的收益率——每年 8% 时，约为 72 ÷ 8 = <strong>9 年</strong>。反过来，若想知道在给定年数内翻倍所需的收益率，则用 72 除以年数。它是精确复利公式的一个心算捷径，而在投资者实际使用的区间里，它的结果出奇地接近。') }}</p>

<h2 id="formula"><span class="est-h2-mark">01</span>{{ t('The formula', '公式') }}</h2>
<div class="formula">
{{ t('<strong>Years to double</strong> ≈ 72 ÷ Return%', '<strong>翻倍年数</strong> ≈ 72 ÷ 收益率%') }}<br>
{{ t('<strong>Return needed</strong> ≈ 72 ÷ Years', '<strong>所需收益率</strong> ≈ 72 ÷ 年数') }}<br>
{{ t('<strong>Exact years</strong> = ln(2) ÷ ln(1 + Return% ÷ 100)', '<strong>精确年数</strong> = ln(2) ÷ ln(1 + 收益率% ÷ 100)') }}<br>
{{ t('<strong>Exact return</strong> = 100 × ( 2^(1 ÷ Years) − 1 )', '<strong>精确收益率</strong> = 100 × ( 2^(1 ÷ 年数) − 1 )') }}
</div>
<p>{{ t('The exact line comes from solving (1 + r)^t = 2 for the missing term. Seventy-two is chosen because it divides cleanly by 2, 3, 4, 6, 8, 9 and 12, making the mental arithmetic easy — and because its error is smallest right around the 6–10% band where the true multiplier of ln(2) ≈ 69.3 would otherwise undershoot.',
   '精确的那一行来自求解 (1 + r)^t = 2 中缺失的那一项。选用 72，是因为它能被 2、3、4、6、8、9、12 整除，心算方便——而且在 6–10% 这个区间里它的误差最小，此处真实系数 ln(2) ≈ 69.3 反而会偏低。') }}</p>

<h2 id="worked"><span class="est-h2-mark">02</span>{{ t('A worked example', '一个算例') }}</h2>
<div class="worked">
<span class="co-h">{{ t('Worked example', '算例') }}</span>
<p>{{ t('Suppose a fund compounds at <span class="num">8%</span> a year and you want to know how long it takes to double.',
   '假设一只基金以每年 <span class="num">8%</span> 复利增长，你想知道它翻倍需要多久。') }}</p>
<ul>
<li>{{ t('Rule of 72 = <span class="num">72 ÷ 8 = 9.00 years</span>', '72法则 = <span class="num">72 ÷ 8 = 9.00 年</span>') }}</li>
<li>{{ t('Exact = <span class="num">ln(2) ÷ ln(1.08) = 9.01 years</span>', '精确值 = <span class="num">ln(2) ÷ ln(1.08) = 9.01 年</span>') }}</li>
<li>{{ t('The estimate is off by about <span class="num">four days</span> — close enough for a decision made in your head.',
   '估算值仅相差约 <span class="num">四天</span>——对于心算决策已足够接近。') }}</li>
</ul>
</div>
<p>{{ t('Now run it the other way: to double in <span class="num">10</span> years you would need roughly <span class="num">72 ÷ 10 = 7.2%</span> a year; the exact requirement is <span class="num">7.18%</span>. Both directions rest on the same shortcut, and both stay honest inside the ordinary range of returns.',
   '再反过来算：要在 <span class="num">10</span> 年内翻倍，你大约需要 <span class="num">72 ÷ 10 = 7.2%</span> 的年化收益；精确要求为 <span class="num">7.18%</span>。两个方向依赖同一个捷径，在通常的收益区间内都保持诚实。') }}</p>

<h2 id="trap"><span class="est-h2-mark">03</span>{{ t('The common trap', '常见陷阱') }}</h2>
<div class="callout warn">
<span class="co-h">{{ t('Treating a rough estimate as a promise', '把粗略估算当成承诺') }}</span>
<p>{{ t('The rule assumes one fixed, positive return compounding without interruption — a straight line that real markets never draw. An average 8% return made of a −20% year and a +40% year does not double capital on the same schedule as a steady 8%; the swings, taxes, fees and any withdrawals all bend the path. The number is a back-of-envelope sketch, not a forecast, and it says nothing about the odds of earning that return in the first place.',
   '该法则假设一个固定的正收益率不间断地复利——一条真实市场从不画出的直线。由 −20% 与 +40% 拼成的平均 8% 收益，翻倍的节奏并不等同于稳定的 8%；波动、税费、成本以及任何提取都会改变这条路径。这个数字是信手勾勒的草图，而非预测，它也完全没有说明你能否首先赚到那样的收益率。') }}</p>
</div>

<h2 id="limits"><span class="est-h2-mark">04</span>{{ t('Where this breaks', '它的局限') }}</h2>
<p>{{ t('The shortcut is a linear approximation of a curve, so it drifts as you leave the middle. A few honest limits:',
   '这个捷径是对一条曲线的线性近似，因此一旦偏离中段就会失真。几点诚实的局限：') }}</p>
<ul>
<li>{{ t('<strong>High rates overshoot.</strong> At 20%+ a year, 72 exaggerates the doubling time — the true multiplier drifts toward 76 or higher. Some traders switch to 70 for low rates and 78 for high ones; the exact math above never has this problem.',
   '<strong>高收益率会高估。</strong>年化超过 20% 时，72 会夸大翻倍所需时间——真实系数会漂移到 76 甚至更高。有人对低收益率改用 70、对高收益率改用 78；上面的精确公式则从无此问题。') }}</li>
<li>{{ t('<strong>It needs a positive return.</strong> A zero or negative return never doubles, so the rule has no answer there. This tool asks for a return above zero rather than printing a meaningless number.',
   '<strong>它需要正收益率。</strong>零或负的收益率永远无法翻倍，法则在此没有答案。本工具会要求输入大于零的收益率，而非印出一个无意义的数字。') }}</li>
<li>{{ t('<strong>Compounding frequency matters.</strong> The formula assumes the return compounds once per year. Monthly or continuous compounding doubles slightly faster, so the same headline rate reaches 2× a touch sooner than the annual figure suggests.',
   '<strong>复利频率有影响。</strong>公式假设每年复利一次。按月或连续复利翻倍略快，因此同样的名义收益率达到 2× 的时间会比按年计算略早一些。') }}</li>
</ul>

<div class="callout key">
<span class="co-h">{{ t('The one line to remember', '记住这一句') }}</span>
<p>{{ t('Seventy-two over the rate is your doubling time in years — a fast, honest sketch inside the 6–10% band, and a curve worth checking exactly once you stray far from it.',
   '72 除以收益率就是以年计的翻倍时间——在 6–10% 区间里是一张快速而诚实的草图，一旦远离这个区间，就值得用精确公式核对。') }}</p>
</div>

<p class="mut" style="font-family:var(--font-ui); font-size:13.5px;">{{ t('See the full curve behind the shortcut with the <a href="' ~ rel ~ 'tools/calculators/compounding.html">compounding calculator</a>, or turn a growth rate into an annualized figure with the <a href="' ~ rel ~ 'tools/calculators/cagr.html">CAGR calculator</a>.',
   '用 <a href="' ~ rel ~ 'tools/calculators/compounding.html">复利计算器</a>查看捷径背后的完整曲线，或用 <a href="' ~ rel ~ 'tools/calculators/cagr.html">年化增长率计算器</a>把增长率换算成年化数字。') }}</p>
{% endblock %}

{% block calc_script %}
<script>
(function(){
  "use strict";

  // ── pure compute (do not re-derive) ────────────────────────────────────────
  // inputs: {mode:"rate"|"years", r annual return %, y years}. Returns an
  // outputs object, or {ok:false, msg} for invalid input. Never NaN/Infinity.
  // rate mode:  est = 72/r ;  exact = ln(2)/ln(1+r/100)   → years
  // years mode: est = 72/y ;  exact = 100*(2^(1/y)-1)     → percent
  function compute(inp){
    var mode = inp.mode === "years" ? "years" : "rate";
    if(mode === "rate"){
      var r = inp.r;
      if(!(r > 0)) return {ok:false, msg:"Enter an annual return above zero — a zero or negative return never doubles."};
      var est = 72 / r;
      var exact = Math.LN2 / Math.log(1 + r / 100);
      return { ok:true, mode:"rate", est:est, exact:exact, gap:est - exact, unit:"years" };
    } else {
      var y = inp.y;
      if(!(y > 0)) return {ok:false, msg:"Enter a number of years above zero to see the return it would take."};
      var estR = 72 / y;
      var exactR = 100 * (Math.pow(2, 1 / y) - 1);
      return { ok:true, mode:"years", est:estR, exact:exactR, gap:estR - exactR, unit:"percent" };
    }
  }

  // ── §6 self-check: run the canonical fixtures on load, console.error on drift ─
  var WORKED_EXAMPLES = [
    { in:{mode:"rate",  r:8},  want:{est:9,    exact:9.01} },
    { in:{mode:"rate",  r:6},  want:{est:12,   exact:11.90} },
    { in:{mode:"years", y:10}, want:{est:7.2,  exact:7.18} }
  ];
  (function selfCheck(){
    WORKED_EXAMPLES.forEach(function(ex, i){
      var got = compute(ex.in), w = ex.want, k;
      if(!got.ok){ console.error("rule-of-72 self-check "+i+": compute failed", got); return; }
      for(k in w){ if(Math.abs(got[k] - w[k]) > 0.01){
        console.error("rule-of-72 self-check "+i+" mismatch on "+k+": got "+got[k]+" want "+w[k]); } }
    });
  })();

  // ── DOM wiring (all reads/writes here; compute stays pure) ─────────────────
  document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", function(){
    var $ = function(id){ return document.getElementById(id); };
    var seg = document.querySelector('.ci-seg[data-name="mode"]');
    var rowRate=$("row-rate"), rowYears=$("row-years"),
        rateEl=$("rate"), yearsEl=$("years"),
        outMain=$("out-main"), outUnit=$("out-unit"), outPlain=$("out-plain"),
        outEst=$("out-est"), outExact=$("out-exact"), outGap=$("out-gap"),
        copyBtn=$("copy-result"), copied=$("copied");

    var mode = "rate";
    var L = document.documentElement.getAttribute("lang") === "zh";

    function numFrom(el){ var v=parseFloat((el.value||"").replace(/,/g,"").trim()); return isFinite(v)?v:NaN; }
    function yrs(n){ return n.toLocaleString("en-US",{minimumFractionDigits:2,maximumFractionDigits:2}); }
    function pct(n){ return n.toLocaleString("en-US",{minimumFractionDigits:2,maximumFractionDigits:2}) + "%"; }
    function dash(){ outMain.textContent="—";
      [outEst,outExact,outGap].forEach(function(e){e.textContent="—";}); }

    var last=null;
    function render(){
      var inp = { mode:mode, r:numFrom(rateEl), y:numFrom(yearsEl) };
      var res = compute(inp); last = res;
      if(!res.ok){ dash(); outPlain.textContent = res.msg; outPlain.className="co-plain"; return; }

      if(res.mode === "rate"){
        outUnit.textContent = L ? "年" : "years";
        outMain.textContent = res.est.toLocaleString("en-US",{minimumFractionDigits:1,maximumFractionDigits:1});
        outEst.textContent   = yrs(res.est) + (L ? " 年" : " yr");
        outExact.textContent = yrs(res.exact) + (L ? " 年" : " yr");
        outGap.textContent   = (res.gap >= 0 ? "+" : "") + yrs(res.gap) + (L ? " 年" : " yr");
        var rTxt = (numFrom(rateEl)).toLocaleString("en-US",{maximumFractionDigits:2});
        outPlain.textContent = L
          ? "以每年 " + rTxt + "% 复利，本金约 " + yrs(res.est) + " 年翻倍（精确 " + yrs(res.exact) + " 年）。"
          : "At " + rTxt + "% a year, money doubles in about " + yrs(res.est) + " years (exact " + yrs(res.exact) + ").";
      } else {
        outUnit.textContent = "%";
        outMain.textContent = res.est.toLocaleString("en-US",{minimumFractionDigits:1,maximumFractionDigits:1});
        outEst.textContent   = pct(res.est);
        outExact.textContent = pct(res.exact);
        outGap.textContent   = (res.gap >= 0 ? "+" : "") + pct(res.gap);
        var yTxt = (numFrom(yearsEl)).toLocaleString("en-US",{maximumFractionDigits:2});
        outPlain.textContent = L
          ? "要在 " + yTxt + " 年内翻倍，约需每年 " + pct(res.est) + " 的收益（精确 " + pct(res.exact) + "）。"
          : "To double in " + yTxt + " years you'd need about " + pct(res.est) + " a year (exact " + pct(res.exact) + ").";
      }
      outPlain.className="co-plain";
    }

    function switchMode(m){
      mode = (m === "years") ? "years" : "rate";
      [].forEach.call(seg.querySelectorAll("button"), function(b){
        var on = b.getAttribute("data-v") === mode;
        b.classList.toggle("on", on); b.setAttribute("aria-checked", on ? "true" : "false");
      });
      if(mode === "rate"){ rowRate.hidden=false; rowYears.hidden=true; }
      else { rowRate.hidden=true; rowYears.hidden=false; }
      render();
    }

    function copyLine(){
      if(!last || !last.ok) return "";
      if(last.mode === "rate"){
        var rTxt = (numFrom(rateEl)).toLocaleString("en-US",{maximumFractionDigits:2});
        return "Rule of 72: at " + rTxt + "% a year money doubles in ~" + yrs(last.est) +
          " years (exact " + yrs(last.exact) + ") — mastermind-x.com";
      }
      var yTxt = (numFrom(yearsEl)).toLocaleString("en-US",{maximumFractionDigits:2});
      return "Rule of 72: doubling in " + yTxt + " years needs ~" + pct(last.est) +
        " a year (exact " + pct(last.exact) + ") — mastermind-x.com";
    }
    copyBtn.addEventListener("click", function(){
      var line=copyLine(); if(!line) return;
      var done=function(){ copied.classList.add("show"); setTimeout(function(){copied.classList.remove("show");},1600); };
      if(navigator.clipboard && navigator.clipboard.writeText){ navigator.clipboard.writeText(line).then(done,done); }
      else { var ta=document.createElement("textarea"); ta.value=line; document.body.appendChild(ta); ta.select();
        try{document.execCommand("copy");}catch(e){} document.body.removeChild(ta); done(); }
    });

    seg.addEventListener("click", function(e){
      var b = e.target.closest("button[data-v]"); if(!b) return;
      switchMode(b.getAttribute("data-v"));
    });
    rateEl.addEventListener("input", render);
    yearsEl.addEventListener("input", render);
    switchMode("rate");
  });
})();
</script>
{% endblock %}
